21	### Profile-Guided Optimization (PGO) — Two-Phase Build
22	
23	PGO requires two separate builds: **generate** (instrumented) → run workload → **use** (optimized).
24	
25	**Clang/GCC (Linux/macOS/WSL):**
26	```bash
27	# Phase 1: Generate profile data
28	cmake -B build_pgo_gen -S . -DENABLE_PGO=ON -DENABLE_LTO=ON
29	cmake --build build_pgo_gen --config Release
30	
31	# Run workload to generate .profraw files
32	LLVM_PROFILE_FILE="pgo_profiles/profile-%p.profraw" ./build_pgo_gen/hello
33	
34	# Merge profiles
35	llvm-profdata merge -o pgo_profiles/merged.profdata pgo_profiles/profile-*.profraw
36	
37	# Phase 2: Build using profile data
38	PGO_USE_PROFILE=pgo_profiles/merged.profdata cmake -B build_pgo_use -S . -DENABLE_PGO=ON -DENABLE_LTO=ON
39	cmake --build build_pgo_use --config Release
40	
41	# Run PGO-optimized binary
42	./build_pgo_use/hello
43	```
44	
