- ✅ No struct workaround needed
- ✅ Shorter code (37 lines → 23 lines)
- ✅ Same zero-overhead performance (1.62 µs avg)
- ✅ Idiomatic C++17
- ✅ Can use `.size()`, range-for, structured bindings if needed later

